  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini, carrot and capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c08edd7d57f2ca82c08c-d384f9cb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 10 minutes remaining, roughly chop brown onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut bake-at-home ciabatta into slices.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a small bowl, combine garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c08edd7d57f2ca82c08c-d08d2c53.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and lentils and cook, stirring, until fragrant and slightly tender, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c08edd7d57f2ca82c08c-981598b0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, brush garlic oil over ciabatta slices.\n• Place ciabatta directly on wire racks in oven and bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c08edd7d57f2ca82c08c-44017ea6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To saucepan with lentils, stir in passata, the water, the brown sugar and vegetable stock powder. Simmer until slightly reduced, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and add roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves, stirring until combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c08edd7d57f2ca82c08c-58f674cb.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby tomato lentil and roast veggie stew between bowls.\n• Top with plant-based basil pesto. Serve with garlic dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64e2c08edd7d57f2ca82c08c-08fe0ceb.jpeg"
    }
  ]
